step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a pure best_single strategy with THETA, the top ranking model overall, to see if a single strong model outperforms the current leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Evaluate a trimmed mean over the full pool to see if including all models improves the selective combination.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a median strategy on pool2 to see if a simple robust average can beat the trimmed_mean pool2 leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the smaller, most stable pool1 to see if it beats the trimmed_mean pool2 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Try a DBA strategy on pool2 to see if the dynamic weighting can beat the trimmed_mean pool2 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Try a robust median over the larger pool3 to see if it beats the trimmed_mean pool2 leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a dynamic weighting (dba) on the smallest stable pool1 to see if adaptive weighting improves over the trimmed_mean pool2 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on pool2 to see if it beats the trimmed_mean leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test DBA on the larger pool3 to see if it beats the trimmed_mean pool2 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle w1 on pool3 to see if it outperforms the trimmed_mean pool2 leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination with inverse_error on pool3 to see if adding CWT_rf improves the leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy on ARIMA to see if it can beat the trimmed_mean pool2 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

